{"version":1,"key":"card:426","content":{"id":426,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"如何打造自己的知识体系。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"75b61d6e-e553-445e-9e67-5d9d14d6e9c7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"49bc2ef1-84e2-41c3-99db-e9a4e55eb5f8","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F_0fadf10f-5dfc-490d-8d58-f1070a07a522.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F_0fadf10f-5dfc-490d-8d58-f1070a07a522.png","width":698},{"children":[{"text":"以项目为分界点，分为两个部分：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a451e9f5-eed2-4125-a9e6-4f9d95a7e457","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"输入，项目之前的流程为输入部分，以正在进行的项目为导向，广泛收集与该项目有关的所有信息，包括但不限于书本、论文、视频、博客、音频等等渠道，在这一步仅作收集，可以是直接对文章的摘录、课堂笔记、突然的灵感，不追求形式，收集的资料可以是一张截图，一个链接，一段话，但是要注意标明出处，方便后续追溯。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0ff1f6f3-7df6-4c89-bfc9-a0580bd0c17b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"这一步最重要的是记，不要追求完美，对自己有帮助，能引发自己的思考就可以记录下来。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3c9e2c6e-e5bb-499e-be2c-93690b099b72","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"59bc9456-3134-4cc7-8ca3-795e5d457094","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"输出，输入代表的仅仅是别人的想法，是未经我们思考加工的资料，无法进一步形成我们的知识体系，内化为我们的学问，为了构建知识体系，首先我们需要对项目中收集的资料进行提炼和总结，形成一张张包含我们思考的卡片。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"44260271-93f4-402d-94da-35e7cd24df3e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"在形成卡片时，我们可以为卡片打上标签分类，或者在卡片中引用其它卡片，通过这两种方式，可以聚类相似的卡片，久而久之，这些卡片会","type":"formatted"},{"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"自下而上","type":"formatted"},{"text":"自动地形成一些主题，通过梳理主题下的卡片，便可以形成系统阐述这一主题的文章。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"db04c114-0d3d-4cac-9761-74d390ac85f5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"这些文章可以认为是我们对某个领域局部的认知，就像盲人摸象，是局部的、片面的，如果要全面、深入且系统的构建该领域的体系结构，我们还需要在卡片和文章的基础上形成知识库，知识库是对该领域一个系统的梳理，知识库可以认为是知识体系在该领域的外在表现，当我们根据已有的文章和卡片打造出一个知识库时，我们的知识体系就已经构建起来了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5b65576d-842e-4080-8d63-66cd99b883a7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"b14cae07-b8a3-46a9-857c-be889f5ec7bf","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"4fa5cc19-72f8-41ec-917e-33afd1813ac8","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"calloutType":"note","children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"项目和知识库不是一一对应的关系，一个知识库可以由多个项目沉淀的内容形成，一个项目也可以同时为多个知识库提供内容，二者时多对多的关系。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4e9a6760-c2fb-4b11-96b2-8c88beac79c8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"3ac5ccd2-f14e-4ba9-83dc-6e945945e56d","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"形成知识库并不是终点，只是初步形成了知识体系，这个知识体系还需要不断的补充和完善，甚至随着认知的深入，知识体系的结构也会随之发生调整","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5e6bcf5b-f452-4d23-9f05-53149a53eece","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"44b3b190-efb2-4ce3-a3bc-76b4465e2830","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"1975471e-62eb-462b-9eeb-e799ef75f6b9","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","type":"numbered-list"}],"collabId":"d0d4c6d9-beac-4917-a205-9ac59577e5a6","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"},{"children":[{"text":"有两种学习方式，自上而下和自下而上：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3a81396b-507c-4be4-ab20-ce9ad845035d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"自上而下是先有一个目标，并且有一个知识框架，然后去收集资料补充框架内容，优点是目的性强，主动性高；缺点是因为是初学者的身份，定的框架不合理，不系统。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"70a18ab2-8336-474f-9977-5f7f27f15645","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"9028ad8c-e9d4-44cd-b281-e9bda30b042d","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"自下而上，先不定框架，自然而然的等待知识点形成网络，优点是框架自然而然生长出来，知识体系系统且合理，缺点是缺乏主动性，知识连接过程缓慢，笔记系统在前期充斥着大量无关的知识点。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"67b6b4b3-531e-438a-9e1f-d6ad144dc800","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"bfeac590-d3ce-422e-8c80-7ed06f23023b","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"ba0fcd2f-25c0-440a-8894-cb7e09b047cc","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"以上知识体系构建流程很好的结合了自上而下和自下而上的学习方式，对于输入是自上而下的，我们以项目为导向去广泛","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"主动地","type":"formatted"},{"text":"收集资料，有很强的目的性，而形成知识体系的过程是自下而上，根据形成的一张张卡片，知识体系自然生长。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"75855169-1bbf-4bd7-b6ab-cb32652c5a5b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"tags":["笔记系统"],"createTime":1714183064379,"updateTime":1793532524765,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532524765}}